#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit SDK provides some tools for converting between OpenQASM "
"representations of quantum programs, and the "
"[QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" class.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit SDK udostępnia narzędzia do konwersji między reprezentacjami OpenQASM"
" programów kwantowych a klasą "
"[QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Import an OpenQASM 2 program into Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Importowanie programu OpenQASM 2 do Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two functions import OpenQASM 2 programs into Qiskit.\n"
"These are [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), which takes a filename, and [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), which takes the OpenQASM 2 program as a string.\n"
msgstr ""
"Do importowania programów OpenQASM 2 do Qiskit służą dwie funkcje.\n"
"Są to [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), która przyjmuje nazwę pliku, oraz [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), która przyjmuje program OpenQASM 2 jako ciąg znaków.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Więcej informacji znajdziesz w [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import simple programs {#import-simple-programs}"
msgstr "Importowanie prostych programów {#import-simple-programs}"

